      "Hello there! I’m doing well, thank you for asking. As a large language model, I don’t really *feel* things in the same way humans do, but I’m functioning perfectly and ready to help out. 😊 \n",
      "\n",
      "How are *you* doing today? Is there anything you’d like to chat about or need help with?\n"
     ]
